+      "content": "### How It Works\n\nThe references chosen on the screen are wired into **Reference to Video** when generating: up to **9 images**, **3 videos** (their first 15 seconds, with their sound if you keep it) and **3 audio clips**.\n\n- Each reference has a tag: **<Picture N>**, **<Video N>**, **<Audio N>**. Tap a reference to put its tag in the prompt; a reference the prompt doesn't name is ignored.\n- A video's sound is numbered before the standalone audio clips.\n- **Megapixels:** 0.01–1.00; **0.4** is balanced, ~1.0 is the 768p native canvas\n- **Aspect width / height:** only the shape (480 x 864 = 9:16 portrait, 864 x 480 = landscape); megapixels sets the size, in multiples of 32\n- **Length:** 124 frames (~5 s at 24 fps); 5 + 17n\n\n---\n\n*Audio alone isn't enough: add at least one image or video. MiniMax H3 uses no negative prompt.*"
